B.Lc=new A.U(B.og,[u.g,"Sorry, I do not understand your question. I am a disaster mitigation training instructor.\n\nI can help with:\n\u2022 Evacuation SOP \u2022 Training Schedule\n\u2022 Emergency Bag \u2022 Evacuation Routes\n\u2022 Ash Mitigation \u2022 Danger Zones\n\u2022 Volcano Status \u2022 First Aid\n\u2022 Emergency Numbers\n\nPlease ask about one of the topics above.","Ngapunten, kula kirang mangertos. Kula instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana.\n\nKula saged mbiyantu:\n\u2022 SOP Evakuasi \u2022 Jadwal Pelatihan\n\u2022 Tas Siaga \u2022 Jalur Evakuasi\n\u2022 Mitigasi Abu \u2022 Zona Bahaya\n\nMonggo tanglet babagan topik ing nginggil.","Ampura, tiang nenten uning. Tiang instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana.\n\nTiang presida nulungin:\n\u2022 SOP Evakuasi \u2022 Jadwal Pelatihan\n\u2022 Tas Siaga \u2022 Jalur Evakuasi\n\nMonggo mataken indik topik ring duur.","Ampura, tyang endeq pati ngerti. Tyang instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana.\n\nTyang presida bantu:\n\u2022 SOP Evakuasi \u2022 Jadwal Pelatihan\n\u2022 Tas Siaga \u2022 Jalur Evakuasi\n\nSilaq betakon soal topik di atas."],t.w)
B.Ld=new A.U(B.og,[u.i,"Hello! I am Si Gumi, your disaster mitigation training instructor. I can help you learn evacuation SOPs, simulation schedules, emergency bag preparation, and preparedness education. How can I assist you?","Halo! Kula Si Gumi, instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana. Kula siap mbantu panjenengan sinau SOP evakuasi, jadwal simulasi, lan persiapan tanggap bencana. Wonten ingkang saged kula bantu?","Om Swastiastu! Tiang Si Gumi, instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana. Tiang siap nulungin ragane malajah SOP evakuasi, jadwal simulasi, miwah persiapan tanggap bencana. Napi sane presida tiang bantu?","Tabe! Tyang Si Gumi, instruktur pelatihan mitigasi bencana. Tyang siap bantu side belajaraq SOP evakuasi, jadwal simulasi, dait persiapan bencana. Napi saq bau tyang bantu?"],t.w)
