B.eD={id:0,en:1}
B.ajy=new A.U(B.eD,["SOP Evakuasi (Materi Pelatihan):\n\n1. Dengarkan alarm/sirine evakuasi dari petugas\n2. Ambil tas siaga yang sudah disiapkan\n3. Ikuti jalur evakuasi yang telah ditentukan\n4. Berjalan cepat dan tertib, jangan panik\n5. Bantu lansia, anak-anak, dan penyandang disabilitas\n6. Kumpul di titik kumpul (balai desa/lapangan)\n7. Petugas akan melakukan absensi kehadiran\n8. Tunggu instruksi selanjutnya dari koordinator\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Latihan rutin akan membuat Anda siap saat situasi sesungguhnya.","Evacuation SOP (Training Material):\n\n1. Listen to the evacuation alarm/siren from officers\n2. Take your pre-prepared emergency bag\n3. Follow designated evacuation routes\n4. Walk quickly and orderly, do not panic\n5. Assist elderly, children, and disabled persons\n6. Gather at assembly point (village hall/field)\n7. Officers will conduct attendance check\n8. Wait for further instructions from coordinator\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Regular drills will prepare you for actual situations."],t.w)
B.ajA=new A.U(B.eD,["Jadwal Pelatihan & Simulasi Bencana:\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 Setiap Bulan Pertama: Simulasi evakuasi tingkat desa\n\ud83d\udcc5 Setiap 3 Bulan: Pelatihan P3K dasar\n\ud83d\udcc5 Setiap 6 Bulan: Simulasi gabungan multi-desa\n\ud83d\udcc5 Setiap Tahun: Gladi besar tanggap bencana\n\nUntuk info jadwal spesifik di daerah Anda:\n\u2022 Hubungi BPBD setempat\n\u2022 Cek grup WhatsApp warga\n\u2022 Tanyakan ke koordinator desa","Disaster Training & Simulation Schedule:\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 Every 1st Month: Village-level evacuation drill\n\ud83d\udcc5 Every 3 Months: Basic first aid training\n\ud83d\udcc5 Every 6 Months: Multi-village joint simulation\n\ud83d\udcc5 Every Year: Large-scale disaster response drill\n\nFor specific schedule in your area:\n\u2022 Contact local BPBD\n\u2022 Check community WhatsApp group\n\u2022 Ask village coordinator"],t.w)
B.ajD=new A.U(B.eD,["Isi Tas Siaga Bencana:\n\n\ud83d\udccb DOKUMEN: KTP, KK, akta (dalam plastik kedap air)\n\ud83d\udc8a KESEHATAN: P3K, obat pribadi, masker N95\n\ud83d\udd26 PERLENGKAPAN: Senter, peluit, powerbank\n\ud83d\udc55 KEBUTUHAN: Pakaian ganti, selimut, makanan kering, air 3 liter, uang tunai\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Siapkan tas siaga SEKARANG, jangan tunggu bencana!","Emergency Bag Contents:\n\n\ud83d\udccb DOCUMENTS: ID, family card, certificates (waterproof bag)\n\ud83d\udc8a HEALTH: First aid kit, personal medicine, N95 masks\n\ud83d\udd26 EQUIPMENT: Flashlight, whistle, powerbank\n\ud83d\udc55 BASICS: Clothes, blanket, dried food, 3L water, cash\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Prepare your emergency bag NOW!"],t.w)
B.ajz=new A.U(B.eD,["Jalur Evakuasi Gunung Merapi:\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f CARA MENGENALI JALUR:\n1. Identifikasi papan rambu evakuasi di desa\n2. Ikuti tanda panah hijau (arah evakuasi)\n3. Catat lokasi titik kumpul terdekat\n\n\ud83d\udccd TITIK KUMPUL MERAPI:\n\u2022 Barak Glagaharjo \u2022 Barak Kepuharjo\n\u2022 Stadion Maguwoharjo \u2022 Balai Desa Umbulharjo\n\n\ud83d\udeb6 TIPS: Hafalkan 2-3 rute alternatif, hindari lembah & sungai.","Merapi Evacuation Routes:\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f HOW TO IDENTIFY ROUTES:\n1. Identify evacuation signs in your village\n2. Follow green arrows (evacuation direction)\n3. Note nearest assembly point\n\n\ud83d\udccd MERAPI ASSEMBLY POINTS:\n\u2022 Glagaharjo Barracks \u2022 Kepuharjo Barracks\n\u2022 Maguwoharjo Stadium \u2022 Umbulharjo Village Hall\n\n\ud83d\udeb6 TIPS: Memorize 2-3 alternative routes, avoid valleys & rivers."],t.w)
B.ajF=new A.U(B.eD,["Mitigasi Hujan Abu Vulkanik:\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f PERSIAPAN: Masker N95, kacamata pelindung, tutup jendela rapat\n\ud83e\udde4 SAAT HUJAN ABU: Pakai masker, baju lengan panjang, hindari luar ruangan\n\ud83e\uddf9 SETELAH: Basahi abu sebelum bersihkan (jangan sapu kering), bersihkan atap bertahap\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Menghirup abu vulkanik dapat menyebabkan gangguan pernapasan.","Volcanic Ash Mitigation:\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f PREP: N95 mask, goggles, close windows tightly\n\ud83e\udde4 DURING: Wear mask, long sleeves, stay indoors\n\ud83e\uddf9 AFTER: Wet ash before sweeping, clean roof gradually\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Inhaling volcanic ash can cause respiratory problems."],t.w)
B.ajE=new A.U(B.eD,["Zona Bahaya Gunung Merapi:\n\n\ud83d\udd34 ZONA MERAH (< 5 km): DILARANG masuk, paling berbahaya\n\ud83d\udfe0 ZONA KUNING (5-10 km): Siap siaga evakuasi kapan saja\n\ud83d\udfe1 ZONA HIJAU MUDA (10-15 km): Pantau informasi, ikuti simulasi\n\ud83d\udfe2 ZONA HIJAU (> 15 km): Relatif aman, tetap waspada\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Kenali zona bahaya daerah Anda SEBELUM bencana!","Merapi Danger Zones:\n\n\ud83d\udd34 RED ZONE (< 5 km): PROHIBITED, most dangerous\n\ud83d\udfe0 YELLOW ZONE (5-10 km): Ready for evacuation anytime\n\ud83d\udfe1 LIGHT GREEN (10-15 km): Monitor info, join drills\n\ud83d\udfe2 GREEN ZONE (> 15 km): Relatively safe, stay alert\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Know your danger zone BEFORE disaster!"],t.w)
B.ajB=new A.U(B.eD,["Pemantauan Status Gunung Merapi:\n\n\ud83c\udf10 SUMBER RESMI: magma.vsi.esdm.go.id\n\ud83d\udcde Call Center BNPB: 117\n\n\ud83d\udcca TINGKAT STATUS:\n\u2022 Level I (Normal) \u2192 Aktivitas dasar\n\u2022 Level II (Waspada) \u2192 Peningkatan aktivitas\n\u2022 Level III (Siaga) \u2192 Kecenderungan erupsi\n\u2022 Level IV (Awas) \u2192 Erupsi segera/berlangsung\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Biasakan cek status gunung secara rutin!","Merapi Volcano Status Monitoring:\n\n\ud83c\udf10 OFFICIAL SOURCE: magma.vsi.esdm.go.id\n\ud83d\udcde BNPB Call Center: 117\n\n\ud83d\udcca STATUS LEVELS:\n\u2022 Level I (Normal) \u2192 Baseline activity\n\u2022 Level II (Alert) \u2192 Increased activity\n\u2022 Level III (Standby) \u2192 Eruption tendency\n\u2022 Level IV (Warning) \u2192 Imminent/ongoing eruption\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Check volcano status regularly!"],t.w)
B.ajC=new A.U(B.eD,["P3K Dasar Kesiapsiagaan:\n\n\ud83e\ude79 PRINSIP: Pastikan area aman, cek kesadaran, cek napas\n\ud83d\udea8 PRIORITAS:\n1. Napas berhenti \u2192 RJP\n2. Pendarahan \u2192 Tekan luka\n3. Luka bakar \u2192 Air mengalir 10+ menit\n4. Patah tulang \u2192 Imobilisasi\n\n\ud83d\udc8a ISI P3K: Perban, antiseptik, gunting, sarung tangan medis\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Ikuti pelatihan P3K resmi untuk keterampilan praktis!","Basic First Aid Preparedness:\n\n\ud83e\ude79 PRINCIPLES: Ensure area safe, check consciousness, check breathing\n\ud83d\udea8 PRIORITY:\n1. No breathing \u2192 CPR\n2. Severe bleeding \u2192 Apply pressure\n3. Burns \u2192 Running water 10+ min\n4. Fractures \u2192 Immobilize\n\n\ud83d\udc8a KIT: Bandages, antiseptic, scissors, medical gloves\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Join official first aid training!"],t.w)
B.ajx=new A.U(B.eD,["Kontak Darurat Bencana:\n\n\ud83d\udcde NOMOR PENTING:\n\u2022 BNPB: 117 \u2022 SAR: 115\n\u2022 Ambulans: 118 \u2022 Polisi: 110\n\u2022 Damkar: 113\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 KONTAK LOKAL:\n\u2022 BPBD Provinsi/Kabupaten\n\u2022 PMI Cabang terdekat\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Gunakan nomor darurat hanya untuk keperluan mendesak!","Emergency Contacts:\n\n\ud83d\udcde IMPORTANT NUMBERS:\n\u2022 BNPB: 117 \u2022 SAR: 115\n\u2022 Ambulance: 118 \u2022 Police: 110\n\u2022 Fire Dept: 113\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Use emergency numbers ONLY for urgent matters!"],t.w)
B.amo=new A.U(B.og,["Panduan Pariwisata Aman (Sleman, Bali, Lombok):\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sleman (DIY): Kaliurang, Candi Prambanan, Lava Tour Merapi (aman jika di luar radius bahaya).\n\ud83c\udf0a Bali: Pantai Kuta, Ubud, Uluwatu, Kintamani (Gunung Batur).\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Lombok: Gili Trawangan, Pantai Senggigi, Gunung Rinjani.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Selalu pantau status gunung berapi aktif setempat sebelum berkunjung!","Safe Tourism Guide (Sleman, Bali, Lombok):\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sleman (DIY): Kaliurang, Prambanan Temple, Merapi Lava Tour (safe outside hazard zones).\n\ud83c\udf0a Bali: Kuta Beach, Ubud, Uluwatu, Kintamani (Mount Batur).\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Lombok: Gili Trawangan, Senggigi Beach, Mount Rinjani.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Always monitor local volcanic status before visiting!","Panduan Wisata Aman (Sleman, Bali, Lombok):\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sleman (DIY): Kaliurang, Candi Prambanan, Lava Tour Merapi (aman yen ing sanjabane zona bahaya).\n\ud83c\udf0a Bali: Pantai Kuta, Ubud, Uluwatu, Kintamani (Gunung Batur).\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Lombok: Gili Trawangan, Pantai Senggigi, Gunung Rinjani.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Eling tansah mriksa status gunung berapi sadurunge budhal plonco!","Panduan Wisata Aman (Sleman, Bali, Lombok):\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sleman (DIY): Kaliurang, Candi Prambanan, Lava Tour Merapi (aman yening ring jabaan zona bahaya).\n\ud83c\udf0a Bali: Pantai Kuta, Ubud, Uluwatu, Kintamani (Gunung Batur).\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Lombok: Gili Trawangan, Pantai Senggigi, Gunung Rinjani.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Tetep cingak status gunung api sadurunge melali!","Panduan Wisata Aman (Sleman, Bali, Lombok):\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sleman (DIY): Kaliurang, Candi Prambanan, Lava Tour Merapi (aman mun leq luar zona bahaye).\n\ud83c\udf0a Bali: Pantai Kuta, Ubud, Uluwatu, Kintamani (Gunung Batur).\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Lombok: Gili Trawangan, Pantai Senggigi, Gunung Rinjani.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Silaq tetep saksian status gunung berapi seberuq bekelor!"],t.w)
